  "home.archetypeTitle": "How do you move a",
  "home.archetypeAccent": "Moment?",
  "home.archetypeCopy": "You do not need to perform the same way as everyone else. Find what is forming, bring the people, catch the energy, remix it, or keep the story.",
  "home.faqEyebrow": "The questions worth asking",
  "home.faqTitle": "Know what counts before you move.",
  "home.faqCopy": "Promorang shows the action, proof requirement, funding source, and possible outcome before you commit. Participation should feel legible.",
  "home.faqReadGuide": "Read the economy guide",
  "home.faq1Q": "Do I have to pay to participate?",
  "home.faq1A": "No. Open actions are free to begin. Paid memberships can add defined allowances and access, but they do not guarantee earnings.",
  "home.faq2Q": "Are Gems an investment?",
  "home.faq2A": "No. Gems provide utility inside Promorang. Holding them does not promise a return, ownership, or cash appreciation.",
  "home.faq3Q": "Who pays for rewards?",
  "home.faq3A": "A reward can come from a disclosed brand, host, merchant, creator, or Promorang-funded pool. Unfunded activity cannot become a cash-equivalent promise.",
  "home.faq4Q": "How does Promorang know I helped?",
  "home.faq4A": "Tracked links, joins, check-ins, submissions, referrals, and reviewable proof connect your contribution to an outcome.",
  "home.orgEyebrow": "For organizers",
  "home.orgTitle": "Name the outcome.",
  "home.orgLine2": "Give people a reason to",
  "home.orgAccent": "make it happen.",
  "home.orgCopy": "Start with one Moment, one action, and one result you can verify. Scale the format after it works.",
  "home.orgTool1Title": "Sell Tickets",
  "home.orgTool1Text": "Seamless ticketing and payouts.",
