  "forMerchants.heartTitle2": "Neighborhood.",
  "forMerchants.heartCopy": "Ready to welcome the storytellers in your scene? List your spot for free and start seeing more local faces, verified visits, and repeat-worthy momentum flow through your doors.",
  "forMerchants.registerSpotNow": "Register Your Spot Now",
