  "forBrands.seoTitle": "Promorang for Brands - Turn Promotions Into Participation",
  "forBrands.seoDescription": "Promorang helps brands turn marketing visibility into measurable consumer participation through Moments, creators, venues, QR engagement, and campaign reporting.",
