  "promoCardExplainer.disclaimer": "PromoCard value is promotional spending value, not a bank loan, deposit account, general-purpose payment card or cash balance. Eligibility and partner terms apply.",
  "promoCardExplainer.step1Title": "Get your PromoCard",
  "promoCardExplainer.step1Text": "Every eligible Promorang account receives a card with a visible promotional spending limit.",
  "promoCardExplainer.step2Title": "Use it with partners",
  "promoCardExplainer.step2Text": "A participating merchant applies the available PromoCard value to an eligible purchase.",
  "promoCardExplainer.step3Title": "Pay the remainder",
  "promoCardExplainer.step3Text": "The customer pays the balance normally. The receipt records the saving and the merchant’s attributed sale.",
  "promoCardExplainer.step4Title": "Recharge through action",
  "promoCardExplainer.step4Text": "Verified check-ins, reviews, referrals, moments and shares can restore available PromoCard value.",
  "promoCardExplainer.memberEyebrow": "Your everyday Promorang benefit",
  "promoCardExplainer.memberTitle": "A PromoCard you can actually use.",
  "promoCardExplainer.memberCopy": "Your PromoCard carries promotional spending value at participating businesses. Apply it at checkout, pay any remainder normally, then recharge it through verified participation.",
  "promoCardExplainer.memberOutcome": "You save on real purchases without turning rewards into a confusing second currency.",
  "promoCardExplainer.merchantEyebrow": "Controlled customer acquisition",
  "promoCardExplainer.merchantTitle": "Turn a small margin allowance into paying customers.",
  "promoCardExplainer.merchantCopy": "You choose the offer, minimum basket and customer limit. PromoCard value reduces the customer’s bill while the remaining purchase is paid normally and attributed to your business.",
  "promoCardExplainer.merchantOutcome": "No blanket discounting: you control the economics and see the revenue each promotion produces.",
  "promoCardExplainer.brandEyebrow": "From attention to verified commerce",
  "promoCardExplainer.brandTitle": "Fund the behavior that leads to a real purchase.",
  "promoCardExplainer.brandCopy": "Sponsor PromoCard recharges, merchant offers or verified actions, then follow the path from participation to redemption and attributable customer spend.",
  "promoCardExplainer.brandOutcome": "Campaign reporting connects reach, proof, redemption and commerce in one measurable journey.",
  "promoCardExplainer.creatorEyebrow": "Attribution that follows the customer",
  "promoCardExplainer.creatorTitle": "Your recommendation can become measurable local commerce.",
  "promoCardExplainer.creatorCopy": "Share participating places and offers through your attributed Promorang links. When your community discovers, visits and redeems, the resulting customer movement can be credited back to you.",
  "promoCardExplainer.creatorOutcome": "Creators build commercial proof from verified visits and purchases—not vanity views alone.",
  "promoCardExplainer.communityEyebrow": "A practical member benefit",
