  "how.layersCopy": "Each part of Promorang answers a specific question for the user while feeding directly into real commerce and community growth.",
  "how.layer1Title": "Discover",
  "how.layer1Question": "What can I do or explore right now?",
  "how.layer1Detail": "A unified feed of weekly drops, tasting battles, hidden gems, merchant offers, and sponsored bounties in your city.",
